StepVerb is enum
StepVerb purpose "What a step of main does"
StepVerb typeParameter none
StepVerb variant doCall none
StepVerb variant setValue none
StepVerb variant jump none
StepVerb variant branchIf none
StepVerb variant branchIfError none
StepVerb variant returnOk none

StepRow is record
StepRow purpose "A step word and the verb it begins"
StepRow typeParameter none
StepRow field text String
StepRow field verb StepVerb

stepWords is table
stepWords purpose "The step words of the stage0 subset (`branch` is refined by the word after it)"
stepWords rowType StepRow
stepWords row doStep 1
stepWords row setStep 2
stepWords row gotoStep 3
stepWords row branchStep 4
stepWords row returnStep 5
stepWords cell doStep text "do"
stepWords cell doStep verb StepVerb.doCall
stepWords cell setStep text "set"
stepWords cell setStep verb StepVerb.setValue
stepWords cell gotoStep text "goto"
stepWords cell gotoStep verb StepVerb.jump
stepWords cell branchStep text "branch"
stepWords cell branchStep verb StepVerb.branchIf
stepWords cell returnStep text "return"
stepWords cell returnStep verb StepVerb.returnOk

