LabelFact purpose "What a label row states, as far as the emitter cares"
LabelFact typeParameter none
LabelFact variant loopKind none
LabelFact variant within none
LabelFact variant maxIterations none
LabelFact variant other none

FactRow is record
FactRow purpose "A label fact word and what it states"
FactRow typeParameter none
FactRow field text String
FactRow field fact LabelFact

