# ---------------------------------------------------------------- what the checker collects

ValueInfo is record
ValueInfo purpose "A value of main: its name, its type word and number, whether `set` may change it, where it comes from (1 constant, 2 let, 3 call result), and the word that sets it first"
ValueInfo typeParameter none
ValueInfo field name syntax.Word
ValueInfo field type syntax.Word
ValueInfo field code Int64
ValueInfo field mutable Bool
ValueInfo field origin Int64
ValueInfo field init syntax.Word
ValueInfo field initIsName Bool
ValueInfo field initialized Bool

Values is typeInstance
Values purpose "Every value of main by name, constants first, then lets and results in source order"
Values instantiates map.Map String ValueInfo

CallInfo is record
CallInfo purpose "A call of main: its name, its target word and number, the values it passes, how many, the value it sets, and whether it can fail"
CallInfo typeParameter none
CallInfo field name syntax.Word
CallInfo field target syntax.Word
CallInfo field code Int64
CallInfo field first syntax.Word
CallInfo field second syntax.Word
CallInfo field arity Int64
CallInfo field result syntax.Word
CallInfo field hasResult Bool
CallInfo field raises Bool

Calls is typeInstance
Calls purpose "Every call of main by name, in source order"
Calls instantiates map.Map String CallInfo

LabelInfo is record
LabelInfo purpose "A label of main: the loop it is within, if any, and its maxIterations bound, if any"
LabelInfo typeParameter none
LabelInfo field name syntax.Word
LabelInfo field within syntax.Word
LabelInfo field nested Bool
LabelInfo field bound syntax.Word
LabelInfo field bounded Bool

Labels is typeInstance
Labels purpose "Every label of main by name, in declaration order"
Labels instantiates map.Map String LabelInfo

Step is record
Step purpose "One checked step of main: its label, its verb, and the words it names (the label word where a verb names fewer)"
Step typeParameter none
Step field label syntax.Word
Step field verb StepVerb
Step field subject syntax.Word
Step field target syntax.Word
Step field otherwise syntax.Word

Steps is typeInstance
Steps purpose "The steps of main in source order"
Steps instantiates list.List Step

Blocks is typeInstance
Blocks purpose "The labels whose steps have been seen, while steps are checked"
Blocks instantiates map.Map String Int64

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- finding words in the tables

lookupPredicate is operation
lookupPredicate purpose "Find a predicate word in the predicates table and return its row"
lookupPredicate invariant none
lookupPredicate typeParameter none
lookupPredicate input source String borrowed
lookupPredicate input word syntax.Word copied
lookupPredicate output Int64
lookupPredicate outputOwnedBy none
lookupPredicate raises syntax.Rejection
lookupPredicate effect none
lookupPredicate uses none
lookupPredicate memoryHeap false
lookupPredicate async false
lookupPredicate maxRecursion none
lookupPredicate label begin loopKind none
lookupPredicate label begin within none
lookupPredicate label scan loopKind forEach
lookupPredicate label scan within none
lookupPredicate label scan maxIterations 36
lookupPredicate label scan over predicates
lookupPredicate label compare loopKind none
lookupPredicate label compare within scan
lookupPredicate label found loopKind none
lookupPredicate label found within none
lookupPredicate label missing loopKind none
lookupPredicate label missing within none
lookupPredicate label outside loopKind none
lookupPredicate label outside within none
lookupPredicate let one Int64 1 immutable
lookupPredicate let position Int64 0 mutable
lookupPredicate at begin do readStart
lookupPredicate at begin do readOffset
lookupPredicate at begin do readLength
lookupPredicate at begin do cutWord
lookupPredicate at begin branch ifError cutWord goto outside else goto scan
lookupPredicate at scan branch ifNext predicates bind entry PredicateRow goto compare else goto missing
lookupPredicate at compare do countRow
lookupPredicate at compare set position nextPosition
lookupPredicate at compare do readText
lookupPredicate at compare do sameText
lookupPredicate at compare branch if isSame goto found else goto scan
lookupPredicate at found return ok position
lookupPredicate at missing do makeMissing
lookupPredicate at missing return error missingError
lookupPredicate at outside do makeOutside
lookupPredicate at outside return error outsideError

