checkStep at begin do readLabelWord
checkStep at begin do readVerbWord
checkStep at begin do labelCheck
checkStep at begin branch ifError labelCheck goto labelCheckFailed else goto labelKnown
checkStep at labelKnown do findVerb
checkStep at labelKnown branch ifError findVerb goto findVerbFailed else goto classify
checkStep at classify match verb StepVerb
checkStep at classify case StepVerb.doCall bind none none goto doStep
checkStep at classify case StepVerb.setValue bind none none goto setStep
checkStep at classify case StepVerb.jump bind none none goto jumpStep
checkStep at classify case StepVerb.branchIf bind none none goto branchStep
checkStep at classify case StepVerb.branchIfError bind none none goto branchStep
