checkStep at targetFound branch ifError findSource goto findSourceFailed else goto sourceFound
checkStep at sourceFound do readMutable
checkStep at sourceFound branch if changeable goto setTypes else goto immutable
checkStep at setTypes do targetCode
checkStep at setTypes do sourceCode
checkStep at setTypes do setTypeCheck
checkStep at setTypes branch if setFits goto makeSetStep else goto setWrongType
checkStep at makeSetStep do makeSet
checkStep at makeSetStep return ok setDone
checkStep at jumpStep do jumpShape
checkStep at jumpStep branch ifError jumpShape goto jumpShapeFailed else goto jumpShaped
checkStep at jumpShaped do readToWord
checkStep at jumpShaped do toCheck
checkStep at jumpShaped branch ifError toCheck goto toCheckFailed else goto toKnown
checkStep at toKnown do makeJump
checkStep at toKnown return ok jumpDone
