checkStep at okChecked branch if isOk goto returnValue else goto badReturn
checkStep at returnValue do findResult
checkStep at returnValue branch ifError findResult goto findResultFailed else goto resultFound
checkStep at resultFound do resultCode
checkStep at resultFound do exitCodeCheck
checkStep at resultFound branch if isExitCode goto makeReturnStep else goto resultWrongType
