diagnose is operation
diagnose purpose "Run the front end on a source and describe the first problem, or say it was accepted"
diagnose invariant reportsFirstProblem "Returns `accepted` for a module in the subset; otherwise the first problem the lexer, rows, model, or subset check finds, as `line:column: message (word)`"
diagnose typeParameter none
diagnose input source String borrowed
diagnose input region Region borrowed
diagnose output String
diagnose outputOwnedBy region
diagnose raises none
diagnose effect none
diagnose uses none
diagnose memoryHeap true
diagnose async false
diagnose maxRecursion none
diagnose label begin loopKind none
diagnose label begin within none
diagnose label rows loopKind none
diagnose label rows within none
diagnose label model loopKind none
diagnose label model within none
diagnose label check loopKind none
diagnose label check within none
diagnose label accepted loopKind none
diagnose label accepted within none
diagnose label lexFailed loopKind none
diagnose label lexFailed within none
diagnose label rowsRefused loopKind none
diagnose label rowsRefused within none
diagnose label modelRefused loopKind none
diagnose label modelRefused within none
diagnose label checkRefused loopKind none
diagnose label checkRefused within none
diagnose let acceptedText String "accepted" immutable
diagnose let lexText String "the lexer refused the source" immutable
diagnose at begin do lex
diagnose at begin branch ifError lex goto lexFailed else goto rows
diagnose at rows do newWords
diagnose at rows do newRows
diagnose at rows do group
diagnose at rows branch ifError group goto rowsRefused else goto model
diagnose at model do newEntities
diagnose at model do newNames
diagnose at model do buildIt
diagnose at model branch ifError buildIt goto modelRefused else goto check
diagnose at check do newValues
diagnose at check do newCalls
diagnose at check do newLabels
diagnose at check do newSteps
diagnose at check do checkIt
diagnose at check branch ifError checkIt goto checkRefused else goto accepted
diagnose at accepted return ok acceptedText
diagnose at lexFailed return ok lexText
diagnose at rowsRefused do describerowsRefused
diagnose at rowsRefused return ok rowsRefusedText
diagnose at modelRefused do describemodelRefused
diagnose at modelRefused return ok modelRefusedText
diagnose at checkRefused do describecheckRefused
diagnose at checkRefused return ok checkRefusedText

